    <properties key="agent.description">
      <value><![CDATA[Credit card approval decision for Maple Northern Bank (fictitious, synthetic data only). Input: application with applicant, address, employment and bureau report. Output: APPROVE, DECLINE or REFER, credit limit (CAD), product, APR tier, reason codes and fired rules. ODM is the system of record; an LLM must not override it.]]></value>
    </properties>
